  "title": {
    "rendered": "Relax masaža"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n\u003Ch1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-xxlarge-font-size wp-elements-0478654932de2258d87c788b0858ed67\" style=\"color:#220b04\"\u003ERelax Masaža\u003C/h1\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-cover aligncenter has-parallax\"\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-1281 has-parallax\" style=\"background-position:50% 50%;background-image:url(https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-hero.png)\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\"\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-a793d9e97eaaa553110cf23564f12640\" style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);line-height:2\"\u003EPrepusti se potpunom smirenju duha i tijela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-6144962b03d9a73137afadf092d36fc6\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\"\u003EUžurbani ritam modernog života često nas ostavlja iscrpljenima i pod stresom. Relax masaža je tvoja oaza mira, stvorena da te nježnim dodirima i ugodnim mirisima odvede u stanje duboke opuštenosti. Dopusti si bijeg od svakodnevice i ponovno pronađi unutarnji mir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-97720e9eda281948ff73035b0c1a3678\" style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);line-height:2\"\u003EŠto je Relax masaža?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-37c0418bb4fc9ffbfb71d80621cd98ff\" style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);line-height:2\"\u003ERelax masaža je nježan i fluidan tretman usmjeren na smanjenje mentalnog i fizičkog stresa. One je idealna za svakoga tko traži bijeg od stresa, želi poboljšati kvalitetu sna, smanjiti tjeskobu ili jednostavno sebi pokloniti trenutke čistog uživanja i dubokog opuštanja.Kroz duge, spore i ritmičke pokrete, uz korištenje toplih ulja i aromaterapije, opušta se svaki mišić, smiruje živčani sustav i potiče osjećaj potpunog blagostanja. Ova masaža nema za cilj rješavanje dubokih mišićnih čvorova, već pružanje maksimalne relaksacije i harmonizacije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-48e9cc5b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-image is-style-rounded\"\u003E\n\u003Cfigure class=\"aligncenter size-full\" style=\"margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"614\" src=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1291\" srcset=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-1-1.png 1024w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-1-1-300x180.png 300w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-1-1-768x461.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /\u003E\u003C/figure\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-13996e22d12fe76a856fe2d92811befb\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrednosti Relax masaže:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cul style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\" class=\"wp-block-list has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-76b78c17d94acb16d1e7a6ff02d5db3b\"\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDubinsko opuštanje:\u003C/strong\u003E Oslobodi se napetosti i stresa nakupljenog u tijelu i umu.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESmanjenje anksioznosti:\u003C/strong\u003E Umirujući dodir i atmosfera pomažu u smanjenju osjećaja tjeskobe.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPoboljšan san:\u003C/strong\u003E Duboka opuštenost doprinosi lakšem usnivanju i kvalitetnijem snu.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\"\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);flex-basis:66.66%\"\u003E\n\u003Cul style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\" class=\"wp-block-list has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-b0bbc593a2623c20b84ac31fadad733e\"\u003E\n\u003Cli class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-89a8f9b52b91fad8ea13358eaa642fe7\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOslobađanje endorfina:\u003C/strong\u003E Potiče lučenje hormona sreće, poboljšavajući raspoloženje.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-a0eb0d0f643a45d2f6ca348cfe235527\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHarmonizacija tijela i duha:\u003C/strong\u003E Pomaže u ponovnom povezivanju sa sobom i pronalaženju unutarnjeg mira.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-435eefd7ea7e9c6a24ccedf2b87d615d\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPotpuno personalizirani pristup\u003C/strong\u003E: Prilagođen specifičnim potrebama svakog pojedinačnog klijenta\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"\u003E\n\u003Cfigure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"578\" src=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-2-1024x578.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1292\" srcset=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-2-1024x578.png 1024w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-2-300x169.png 300w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-2-768x433.png 768w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/relax-2.png 1237w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /\u003E\u003C/figure\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n",
